<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T4.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="S5.T4.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Quantitative results on <span id="S5.T4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lidar SOD</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">46</a>]</cite>. We compare our proposed baselines, CC-SAM2 and HM2F-Video, to various state-of-the-art methods <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">22</a>, <a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">30</a>, <a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>, <a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">4</a>, <a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">41</a>, <a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>, <a href="#bib.bib37" title="" class="ltx_ref">37</a>, <a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>, <a href="#bib.bib52" title="" class="ltx_ref">52</a>]</cite>. Best results are in <span id="S5.T4.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> and second best are <span id="S5.T4.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</span></figcaption>
